{"type":"message","id":"729d8340","parentId":"efc6d27b","timestamp":"2026-03-30T06:27:38.226Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ecde760f4fe84a19afe9f341","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Gateway service disabled.\nStart with: openclaw gateway install\nStart with: openclaw gateway\nStart with: systemctl --user start openclaw-gateway.service\nStart with: systemd user services are unavailable; install/enable systemd or run the gateway under your supervisor.\nStart with: If you're in a container, run the gateway in the foreground instead of `openclaw gateway`.\n\n\nProcess exited with code 0."}],"details":{"status":"completed","sessionId":"keen-willow","exitCode":0,"aggregated":"Gateway service disabled.\nStart with: openclaw gateway install\nStart with: openclaw gateway\nStart with: systemctl --user start openclaw-gateway.service\nStart with: systemd user services are unavailable; install/enable systemd or run the gateway under your supervisor.\nStart with: If you're in a container, run the gateway in the foreground instead of `openclaw gateway`.\n","name":"openclaw gateway"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774852058223}}
{"type":"message","id":"d8303946","parentId":"729d8340","timestamp":"2026-03-30T06:27:56.650Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Gateway 被禁用了。用户需要先安装或启用 gateway。在这种情况下，我无法直接调用飞书工具。我需要告诉用户这个限制，并提供一个替代方案。让我给用户两个选择：\n1. 用户手动获取 doc token 然后我可以用 feishu_doc 工具写入\n2. 用户直接把内容复制到文档中我可以给用户提供完整的格式化内容，让用户手动复制到飞书文档中。或者，我可以尝试让用户通过其他方式启用 gateway。让我先检查一下用户是否有权限安装 gateway。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_69317f1cc2c54f05bbc82c01","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw gateway install 2>&1 | head -20","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774852058226,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4a5401d3bfe00eea20d4624d760d4130"}}
