{"type":"message","id":"d2148fbc","parentId":"e13defd9","timestamp":"2026-03-30T08:29:02.755Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_146da592e16b4ffc9a019cf1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.24 (unknown) — Open source means you can see exactly how I judge your config.\n\nUsage: openclaw agent [options]\n\nRun an agent turn via the Gateway (use --local for embedded)\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>               Agent id (overrides routing bindings)\n  --channel <channel>        Delivery channel:\n                             last|telegram|whatsapp|discord|irc|googlechat|slack|signal|imessage|line\n                             (omit to use the main session channel)\n  --deliver                  Send the agent's reply back to the selected channel\n                             (default: false)\n  -h, --help                 Display help for command\n  --json                     Output result as JSON (default: false)\n  --local                    Run the embedded agent locally (requires model\n                             provider API keys in your shell) (default: false)\n  -m, --message <text>       Message body for the agent\n  --reply-account <id>       Delivery account id override"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":5433,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.24 (unknown) — Open source means you can see exactly how I judge your config.\n\nUsage: openclaw agent [options]\n\nRun an agent turn via the Gateway (use --local for embedded)\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>               Agent id (overrides routing bindings)\n  --channel <channel>        Delivery channel:\n                             last|telegram|whatsapp|discord|irc|googlechat|slack|signal|imessage|line\n                             (omit to use the main session channel)\n  --deliver                  Send the agent's reply back to the selected channel\n                             (default: false)\n  -h, --help                 Display help for command\n  --json                     Output result as JSON (default: false)\n  --local                    Run the embedded agent locally (requires model\n                             provider API keys in your shell) (default: false)\n  -m, --message <text>       Message body for the agent\n  --reply-account <id>       Delivery account id override","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774859342752}}
